@base = http://localhost:5000
### Legacy client expects meterId, kwh and timestampUtc
GET {{base}}/api/v1/readings
Accept: application/json

### New client accepts all v1 fields plus quality
GET {{base}}/api/v2/readings
Accept: application/json

### Negative case: Production should not expose Swagger
GET {{base}}/swagger/index.html

### Negative case: anonymous write rejected
POST {{base}}/api/v1/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{"meterId":"b6764e22-92e1-4be0-9f32-f40c3d849d12","kwh":10.2,"timestampUtc":"2026-11-05T00:00:00Z"}
